@startuml
title ExitPass Fiscal Issuance Failure Exception Flow

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam participantPadding 24
skinparam boxPadding 12

actor "Parker / operator" as User
participant "Channel / terminal" as Channel
participant "Central PMS" as PMS
participant "Site POS Server" as POS
participant "Exception / retry workflow" as Exception
participant "Supervisor" as Supervisor
participant "Reconciliation" as Reconciliation

PMS -> PMS : Verified payment finality\nis recorded
PMS -> POS : Request Sales Invoice issuance
POS -x PMS : Fiscal issuance failure\nor timeout
PMS -> PMS : Block ExitAuthorization
PMS -> Exception : Create fiscal issuance\nexception case
Exception -> Channel : Customer/operator message:\npayment received,\nfiscal issuance pending,\nexit not yet available
Exception -> POS : Retry Sales Invoice issuance

alt Retry succeeds
    POS --> Exception : Sales Invoice identity / status
    Exception --> PMS : Fiscal issuance reference
    PMS -> PMS : Record fiscal issuance reference
    PMS -> Channel : ExitAuthorization may proceed
else Manual release allowed by policy
    Exception -> Supervisor : Request approval
    Supervisor --> Exception : Approve with reason
    Exception -> Reconciliation : Incident tag +\nreconciliation tag
    Exception --> PMS : Controlled exception closure
    PMS -> Channel : Manual release outcome\nper policy
else No approved closure
    Exception -> Channel : Continue pending / retry\nor operational escalation
end

note over PMS,Exception
Payment is not automatically reversed.
ExitAuthorization is blocked until fiscal issuance succeeds
or a controlled supervisor-approved exception is allowed.
end note

@enduml
